[thin] Specified 2 mm floor and 2.38 mm standing casing section. Derek selected these sections and the 253.4 mm assembled cold-core height. The sampled pair spans the ordinary floor, rather than a cut remnant or a tapered fin. All ten M5 head pads and their wall/floor roots have separate 100% solid deposition modifiers.
alternatives: A 3 mm floor raises the retained stack by 1 mm or reduces the foam depth by 1 mm; that changes the specified floor and stack. Additional local head-bearing stock is already part of the M5 pads and their solid root regions.
